---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { firstImage } from '../lib/assets';

const portrait = firstImage('profile-pic-2021-edit.jpg');
const linkedinLogo = firstImage('li-logo-131x32px.png');
const naepc = firstImage('naepc-500x150.png');
const step = firstImage('step-transparent-500x150.png');
---
<Base title="About" description="Trust Management Group, LLP: expert consulting in all forms of personal trust and estate matters, including fiduciary litigation. Led by Gary Matesic, AEP®, TEP®.">
  <PageHero title="About Trust Management Group, LLP" image="canstockphoto45375643.jpg" />

  <section class="band">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="lead">Expert consulting in all forms of personal trust and estate matters, including fiduciary litigation.</h2>
      <div class="heading-rule"></div>
      <div class="layout">
        <aside class="profile">
          {portrait && <img src={portrait} alt="Gary Matesic" width="260" />}
          <h3>Gary Matesic, AEP®, TEP®</h3>
          <p><a href="/consulting#gary">See more about Gary Matesic »</a></p>
          {linkedinLogo && <p><a href={site.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Gary Matesic on LinkedIn"><img src={linkedinLogo} alt="LinkedIn" width="131" height="32" /></a></p>}
          <p><a href={site.vcard} download>Download Gary’s vCard.</a></p>
        </aside>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>Trust Management Group, LLP was formed in {site.since} by longtime trust and wealth management professional Gary Matesic, along with Plano entrepreneur, grant writer and Wharton School alum Mike Shea, to provide litigation consulting and expert witness testimony in breach of fiduciary duty cases.</p>
          <p>We are pleased to announce that after spending the past 13 years building and managing bank trust and wealth management departments, Gary has returned to Trust Management Group and his previous practice of expert consulting in all forms of non-litigation personal trust and estate matters, together with supporting plaintiffs, defendants, and their legal counsel with respect to fiduciary controversies.</p>
          <p>In addition, he continues to consult on, appraise, acquire, maintain, and liquidate not only individual collector motor vehicles, but entire collections. Gary is also well-equipped to assist fiduciaries, their advisors, and individuals in the disposition and acquisition of late-model vehicles typically owned by estates, trusts, and guardianships.</p>
          <p><strong>Please call or email to discuss your particular needs.</strong></p>
          <p><a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>
          {(naepc || step) && (
            <div class="badges">
              {naepc && <img src={naepc} alt="National Association of Estate Planners & Councils" width="200" />}
              {step && <img src={step} alt="Society of Trust and Estate Practitioners" width="200" />}
            </div>
          )}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .lead { font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.8vw, 1.9rem); max-width: 40ch; }
  .layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 270px 1fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem); align-items: start; }
  .profile img { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .profile h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; }
  .badges { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
